    17	 * WHY THE PANEL CHECKS BEFORE IT DRAWS. Each entry is optional and starts
    18	 * missing. A link that goes nowhere is worse than no link — you press it, the
    19	 * screen does not change, and you are left wondering what you did wrong. So the
    20	 * panel only draws a link once the door behind it is actually there.
    21	 *
    22	 * No `$effect`, no backend call, nothing at import: this module holds two
    23	 * functions and hands them out.
    24	 */
