   142	
   143	### 4.1 ACP foundation
   144	
   145	Use the official Rust SDK as the client transport:
   146	
   147	- `agentclientprotocol/rust-sdk`
   148	- stable session config options for model, mode, thought level, and arbitrary selectors;
   149	- stable session list/resume/close capabilities;
   150	- image prompt capability negotiation;
