   153	
   154	Use pinned official adapters initially:
   155	
   156	- `agentclientprotocol/codex-acp` — Codex app-server mapping for models, effort, Fast mode, permissions/sandbox, images, commands, file changes, reasoning, plans, reviews, web search, token/rate usage, and subagents;
   157	- `agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp` — Claude Agent SDK mapping for models/options, images, tool permissions, TODOs, edit review, terminals, custom commands, MCP, and nested subagent transcripts.
   158	
