   166	- provider adapters under `apps/server/src/provider`;
   167	- `ChatMarkdown.tsx` for safe, streaming Markdown behavior.
   168	
   169	Assembly needs the same broad separation of:
   170	
   171	- session/thread/turn lifecycle;
